# Host hypervisor exceptions for `trivy config`.
#
# zyvor-fabricd and FluxVM run as root on the host network so they can drive
# KVM, nftables, TAP/netns, and bpffs. These IDs are required there; they are
# not a general waiver for other manifests (add a new ID here only with a
# reason). Operator images already run as non-root and stay in scope.

DS-0002
KSV-0005
KSV-0009
KSV-0010
KSV-0014
KSV-0017
KSV-0118
KSV-0119
